    {"• 仅保存本地安全审计日志，绝不上传云端。", "• Only save local security audit logs and never upload them to the cloud."},
    {"• 仅影响今天，次日自动恢复常规周计划", "• Only affects today, and will automatically resume the regular weekly plan the next day"},
    {"• 优先顺序：指定日期额度 > 节假日 > 周计划", "• Priority order: Specified date quota > Holidays > Weekly plan"},
    {"• 偏好将持久保存在 SD 卡配置文件中。", "• Preferences are persisted in the SD card configuration file."},
    {"• 兑换后自动计入今日额度；若主机处于离线或外出状态同样支持校验", "• After redemption, it will automatically be included in today’s quota; if the host is offline or out of town, verification is also supported"},
    {"• 到就寝时间后立即限制使用，即使今日还有额度也一样", "• Limit usage immediately after bedtime, even if there is still credit available today"},
    {"• 加时码包含防重放与天数校验，当日有效，不可跨日或重复兑换", "• The extra time code includes anti-replay and day verification. It is valid on the same day and cannot be redeemed across days or repeatedly."},
    {"• 包含长按确认完成、危险警示与额度耗尽音效。", "• Contains long press to confirm completion, danger warning and credit exhaustion sound effects."},
    {"• 在孩子区任意界面长按该键可直接呼出 PIN 验证。", "• Long press this key on any interface in the kids area to directly call out PIN verification."},
    {"• 如需例外，可在今日调度中选择“跳过今晚就寝”，只跳过这一次", "• If you need an exception, select \"Skip bedtime tonight\" in today's schedule to skip just this one time"},
    {"• 家长可直接在上方选择快捷时长或自定义分钟生成 8 位加时码", "• Parents can directly select the shortcut time or customize the minute to generate an 8-digit extra time code"},
    {"• 将相册入口重定向至自制程序菜单（hbmenu）。", "• Redirect photo album entry to homebrew menu (hbmenu)."},
    {"• 就寝时间仍独立生效，到点强制锁机休息", "• Bedtime still takes effect independently, and the phone is forced to lock and take a rest when the time comes."},
    {"• 就寝时间可跨日（如 22:00 至次日 07:00），结束后自动恢复", "• Bedtime can span days (such as 22:00 to 07:00 the next day), and will automatically resume after the end"},
    {"• 就寝时间：到点限制，不受额度影响", "• Bedtime: time limit, not affected by quota"},
    {"• 开关关闭时，节假日和调休的就寝设置暂不生效。", "• When the switch is turned off, the bedtime settings for holidays and rest days will not take effect temporarily."},
    {"• 开启后需在桌面“手柄设置”上按住 X 再按 A 进入。", "• After turning it on, you need to press and hold X and then press A on the desktop \"Controller Settings\" to enter."},
    {"• 开启日历后，国家法定休假与调休工作日将自动优先于每周基础计划生效。", "• After opening the calendar, national statutory holidays and compensated days off will automatically take precedence over the basic weekly plan."},
    {"• 异常防护：离线运行，断网断电保护", "• Abnormal protection: offline operation, network and power outage protection"},
    {"• 提供浅色、深色及跟随系统三种主题模式。", "• Provides three theme modes: light, dark and follow the system."},
    {"• 提供清脆的按键、微齿轮拨轮与弹窗提示音。", "• Provides crisp buttons, micro-gear wheel and pop-up sound."},
    {"• 支持 4-8 位数字密码，请妥善保管勿告知孩子。", "• Supports 4-8 digit password, please keep it safe and do not tell your children."},
    {"• 支持 Minus、Capture 或手柄组合键自定义配置。", "• Supports custom configuration of Minus, Capture or controller key combinations."},
    {"• 支持手柄 L / R 快捷翻页浏览与一键清空日志。", "• Supports handle L/R for quick page browsing and one-click clearing of logs."},
    {"• 支持简体中文、繁體中文、English 等多语言。", "• Supports Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English and other languages."},
    {"• 方便家长快速进入后台，避免孩子随意翻看。", "• It is convenient for parents to quickly enter the background and prevent children from browsing randomly."},
    {"• 深色模式优化 OLED 屏幕省电与护眼显示。", "• Dark mode optimizes OLED screen power saving and eye-friendly display."},
    {"• 用于保护家长区设置、高风险操作与密钥导出。", "• Used to protect parental zone settings, high-risk operations, and key export."},
    {"• 自主缓冲：限时日耗尽前由孩子申请", "• Autonomous buffer: applied by the child before the time limit runs out"},
    {"• 记录额度调整、离线加时、就寝跳过与保护事件。", "• Records credit adjustment, offline grant, bedtime skip and protection events."},
    {"• 设置 PlayWise 主机管理端与游戏内浮窗的语言。", "• Set the language for PlayWise console management and in-game pop-up windows."},
    {"• 设置仍会保存；按 [-] 键或打开上方“就寝计划总开关”后按计划生效。", "• The settings will still be saved; they will take effect as planned after pressing the [-] key or turning on the \"Bedtime Plan Master Switch\" above."},
    {"• 设置即时保存并在所有界面与组件中生效。", "• Settings are saved instantly and take effect in all interfaces and components."},
    {"• 调休工作日建议设为严格就寝；法定休假可根据需要放宽或免除就寝限制。", "• It is recommended to set strict bedtime restrictions on rest days; statutory holidays can relax or exempt bedtime restrictions as needed."},
